		<description><![CDATA[@Evan, yes, DAY_OF_YEAR starts at 1 according to http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/api/java/util/Calendar.html#DAY_OF_YEAR Your code looks good.

I like your modification (playing Billy Jean) :) It feels like a way less cynical piece, and much more optimistic.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>@Evan, yes, DAY_OF_YEAR starts at 1 according to <a href="http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/api/java/util/Calendar.html#DAY_OF_YEAR" rel="nofollow">http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/api/java/util/Calendar.html#DAY_OF_YEAR</a> Your code looks good.</p>
<p>I like your modification (playing Billy Jean) :) It feels like a way less cynical piece, and much more optimistic.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
